            <Class>
                <__p_description>This is a language class. It implements the C++ language.

This class can also be extended with an extremely tight set of requirements. Another language can extend the C++ language if it uses all the same block indexes, and properly creates blocks from its own language that extend any C++ blocks. The parsing, root block, and routing must be identical.</__p_description>
